# Mirrex: "{T}: Add {C}." and "{T}: Add one mana of any color. Activate only if this land entered this turn." (CR 602.5b).
# Played on turn 1, it taps for one blue mana, and once tapped offers neither ability (the {T} of each cost). On turn 3 it
# entered two turns ago: "any color" is no longer offered, and "{T}: Add {C}" adds one colorless mana.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mirrex
Island x19

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mirrex.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mirrex.Activate(Ability: any color; Color: Blue)
? Bot1.Mana = {U}
! Bot1.Battlefield.Mirrex.Activate(Ability: Add {C})
! Bot1.Battlefield.Mirrex.Activate(Ability: any color)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Mana = 
! Bot1.Battlefield.Mirrex.Activate(Ability: any color)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mirrex.Activate(Ability: Add {C})
? Bot1.Mana = {C}

